        "text": "Technological dominance correlates with national competitive advantage.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "AI innovation should be subject to government regulation or policy intervention.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker trusts that the introduction of legislation reflects meaningful progress toward responsible AI.",
        "confidence": 0.87
      },
